## English

This repository includes an instruction set developed with substantial reference to the original guidance document `CLAUDE.md` from:

  forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills
  https://github.com/forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills

The original repository describes that document as a Claude Code guideline set derived from Andrej Karpathy's observations on LLM coding pitfalls.

This repository is an independent adaptation for Codex-oriented workflows and the maintainer's own research and coding environment. It includes modifications, reorganization, additions, and project-specific rules.

This repository is not affiliated with or endorsed by Forrest Chang or Andrej Karpathy.

Where original wording or structure has been reused in a substantial way, the corresponding license notice from the original repository should be preserved.

